Z||000000||88formula||07-08-2001||07:16 PM||||It was a bi_ch but I finally got the engine in. I'll also say that unless I have a garage and a lift I will never attempt to do this again. Here are some pictures.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_2.JPG">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_1.JPG"> <BR>[img]<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mark_and_John.JPG"> <BR>How I got the car up this high.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jacks.JPG"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||07-08-2001||07:18 PM||||Front suspension fully restored with polyurethane bushings, KYB shocks, new ball joints, new brakes, and everything painted black. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/front_suspension.JPG"> <BR>Lower control arm.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lower_control_arm.JPG"> <BR>While the car was out of commission something made the best use of it and made a nest next to my computer.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rat_nest.JPG"> <BR>The interior is a mess.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior_2.JPG">   <P>||||reg||1
