Z||000007||My7Fieros||07-09-2001||04:42 PM||||Wow! I agree w/ KRMFiero...that thing looks like it just came off the assembly line! Now <B><I>that's</B></I> how you save a Fiero! You did a job you can be proud of! Great job! M7F||||reg||14
Z||000008||88formula||07-09-2001||05:09 PM||||I only wish more people would build a sixty-degree engine and not rip it out for a different engine. V8 and 3800 engines are cool and arguably better but in my humble opinion it ruins the originality of the car and in some cases the handling. You could say yeah but you have a Camaro engine in there; but it’s still a sixty-degree v6 engine from the same family that looks stock only now it’s grown up and meaner. <P>Thanks for the comment.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000009||88CoupeV6||07-09-2001||05:20 PM||||Glad to hear you got the engine finally in. I know what you mean about the garage. I wish I had one too. I've had my engine cradle out 3 times and it stinks doing it in the great outdoors. Now maybe you can make it to the Kick-Hill swap meet this weekend. Would love to see you there and chat. Here is a link to more info <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum7/HTML/000018.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum7/HTML/000018.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
Z||000010||Santa Cruzer||07-09-2001||08:00 PM||||Good job man much prop's looks like a factory job,it must have been a *****  doing it on grass!!.. it looks 10000000000000000000000000000000times better then this 2.8! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Butchered_2.8L_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>red candy apple copper burgandy color,tan interior all options,american racing rims,Pioneer Cd Player,pioneer 120w speakers"in factory location",sony ****  amp,and workin' on a girl to go with the package<BR>www.geocities.com/fierose_1986/dts.html  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/me!!!.jpg"> ||||reg||1
